    "field_number": "field_number",
    "field_checkbox": "field_checkbox",
    "and related fields become neutral attributes with their Blockly declaration preserved.": "y otros campos relacionados se convierten en atributos neutrales conservando su declaración Blockly.",
    "Inputs → relations.": "Entradas → relaciones.",
    "input_value": "input_value",
