    "checks are retained so they can later be projected to independent validation rules or back to Blockly.": "se conservan para poder proyectarlos después a reglas de validación independientes o de vuelta a Blockly.",
    "JavaScript is never executed.": "JavaScript nunca se ejecuta.",
